      },
      "message": "feat(catalog): example case edm/sinker with Sinker Burn and Sinker Side Burn\n\nAdd the catalog case examples/catalog/edm/sinker. A rough Sinker Burn\nburns a blind rectangular cavity with an electrode from\nelectrode_from_faces. A Sinker Side Burn then burns to the floor and\nmoves the electrode 0.22 mm toward +X and back, on the shipped sinker\ntemplate with invented, labelled conditions and code words.\n\nPin the case with catalog_edm_sinker::{regenerates,rebuilds} and\nsinker_case_posts_the_burn_and_the_side_burn. The guide pages of both\nkinds now link the case.\n\nFixes #2872\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
